From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Schultz <alexschultz002@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 01:34:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(vi.h): doxygen comments

Hand port of 7f8eab60 onto the patched tree, with audit verdicts:
- @file: lsp.c group, tree-sitter interface under led.c, agent in agent.h.
- struct buf: topsub on the shared row/off/top line; et/sw/ts and lbuf.edseq keep their patch text as ///< comments.
- exbuf_load/exbuf_save also copy topsub and et/sw/ts.
- 'ints' in rset.grpnsubc and the attribute layout comment become words (s64).
- emalloc/erealloc/dstrlen/itoa now live here as statics (upstream move); their briefs move from vi.c/led.c.
- rset_smake/uc_chr/uc_sub briefs moved to their new definitions (regex.c, uc.c); uc_dup prototype is gone.
Comments only; stripped binary identical.
---
 vi.h | 298 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------------------
 1 file changed, 178 insertions(+), 120 deletions(-)

